    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REGOLITH: VIOZIC SUNS is a top-down, roguelite space shooter game for PC set within a handcrafted and procedurally-generated galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of an illegally-immortal mercenary pilot looking to secure their name in fame and notoriety with the help of a motley crew of contractors that may or may not have your best interests in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alter your ship's equipment and internals to your liking and playstyle - or towards the needs of your missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and push the limits of where you're allowed to be...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>REGOLITH is still in its early development stages, and has a long way to go. Please be patient, I'm just one guy!</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >REGOLITH: VIOZIC SUNS is a top-down, roguelite space shooter game for PC set within a handcrafted and procedurally-generated galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of an illegally-immortal mercenary pilot looking to secure their name in fame and notoriety with the help of a motley crew of contractors that may or may not have your best interests in mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alter your ship's equipment and internals to your liking and playstyle - or towards the needs of your missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world and push the limits of where you're allowed to be...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>REGOLITH is still in its early development stages, and has a long way to go. Please be patient, I'm just one guy!</i></p>",
